			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"楊尼斯"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730190501,
					"content": "我家一直是在這條道上來往經商的，從層岩巨淵到須彌。從璃月進口寶石原礦，再把香料送過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190502,
					"content": "有一次，因為有什麼事情…記不清了，反正老爹把我留在了化城郭，好長一段時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190503,
					"content": "我記得當時在林子裡，認識了一個朋友。我們一起到處跑，後來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190504,
					"content": "後來的事情，我都不記得了。他叫什麼名字，長什麼樣子，也不記得了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190505,
					"content": "我只記得那時候好像很開心。後來老爹終於回來了，把我接走了。我也想過，要回去找他，但一直沒有機會，後來就忘了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190506,
					"content": "#如果不是因為{F#妳}{M#你}向我要糖，這些事情，我應該早就全忘了才對。為什麼會這樣呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "楊尼斯"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7301906,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7301906
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7301906",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7301906,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭薩卡",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730190601,
					"content": "#就是這個！沒想到{F#妳}{M#你}們這麼快就拿回來了…是真的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190602,
					"content": "#不會是{F#妳}{M#你}們為了騙我，所、所以仿造出來的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190603,
					"content": "就靠你那些描述，能仿造出來才怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190604,
					"content": "你要是不放心，就自己嚐嚐看嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190605,
					"content": "#…{F#妳}{M#你}們不會往裡面放了奇怪的東西吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190606,
					"content": "當然不會啦，哼，你到底試不試，不試的話我們就拿走啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190607,
					"content": "#不、不行…{F#妳}{M#你}們不要拿走，讓我、讓我嚐嚐看嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190608,
					"content": "不要拿走啦，我現在就嚐，現在就嚐…唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190609,
					"content": "啊，是真的…是「開心的味道」，就是這個味道…嘿嘿…再一次嚐到，還是覺得開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190610,
					"content": "沒想到又能嚐到這樣的味道…呀，但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190611,
						730190612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190611,
					"content": "怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190613,
					"content": "唔…怎麼說呢…「開心的味道」還是和以前一樣，但是不知道為什麼，感覺吃起來沒有第一次吃那樣開心了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190614,
					"content": "難道他給我們的糖不甜嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190615,
					"content": "不是的，不是味道有差別…但是明明以前和朋友一起吃的時候…那是我第一次品嚐「開心的味道」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190616,
					"content": "總覺得那個時候要比現在開心許多，到底是為什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190617,
					"content": "#那不是滿正常的嘛，就算是同一道菜，每次{NICKNAME}做出來的味道都不一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190618,
					"content": "我吃的時候心情也不一樣呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190619,
						730190620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190619,
					"content": "確實。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190621,
					"content": "…不、不會的，一定有一種方法，讓我像第一次品嚐「開心的味道」時那樣開心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190622,
					"content": "我知道了，那個時候我是和朋友一起吃的。所以，「開心的味道」要和朋友一起，才會變得好吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190623,
					"content": "#一定是這樣的。{F#妳}{M#你}們是好那菈，而且，找到了「開心的味道」。{F#妳}{M#你}們，是朋友。我要做給{F#妳}{M#你}們吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190624,
					"content": "嗯，我們是朋友！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190625,
					"content": "蘭薩卡立刻開始烹飪，將墩墩桃與糖加入鍋中…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190626,
					"content": "#隨後，蘭薩卡將成品交給{F#妳}{M#你}與派蒙。\\n果不其然，除了壓倒性的「甜」以外，並沒有什麼味道。\\n可能這就是「開心的味道」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190627,
					"content": "啊，真是開心的味道。太美味了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190628,
					"content": "嗯，這道菜還挺…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190629,
					"content": "還挺「開心」的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190630,
						730190631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190630,
					"content": "太甜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190632
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190632,
					"content": "我也覺得，實在是太甜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190633,
					"content": "是、是嘛，欸呀，我好像一口氣放得太多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190634,
					"content": "但是…嘿嘿，果然，果然要和朋友一起分享，「開心的味道」才會更開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190635,
					"content": "#雖然和第一次吃到「開心的味道」的時候感受到的開心也有區別，但是和{F#妳}{M#你}們一起吃…我感到了另外一種開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190636,
						730190637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190636,
					"content": "開心就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190638,
					"content": "#一開始的時候我還懷疑{F#妳}{M#你}們心懷不軌，但是{F#妳}{M#你}們不計前嫌，還、還幫我找到了「開心的味道」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190639,
					"content": "#有{F#妳}{M#你}們的幫助，我才能做完我的「至上珍饈」，完成「烹飪修行」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190640,
					"content": "這都不算什麼啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190641,
					"content": "#那、那怎麼可以，{F#妳}{M#你}們幫了我那麼多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190642,
					"content": "#對了。我教{F#妳}{M#你}們，這個菜餚的做法。這樣的話，以後{F#妳}{M#你}們就能和朋友，分享「開心的味道」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭薩卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190643,
					"content": "（嗯…如果改一下原料的配方，再加點別的，應該可以做成不錯的點心…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730190637,
					"content": "我想喝水…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190631,
					"content": "我想喝水。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190632
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190620,
					"content": "還有這種事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190621
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730190612,
					"content": "有什麼問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730190613
					]
				}
			]
		},
